<Layout title="Privacy Policy | StackGuide" description="StackGuide's privacy policy covering data collection, cookies, affiliate links, and third-party services.">
  <main style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <p>StackGuide ("we", "us", or "our") operates the website stackguide.net. This page explains how we collect and use information when you visit our site.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to collect anonymous data about site visitors, including pages visited, time spent on pages, and general geographic location. This data is used to improve our content and is not shared with third parties.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Google Analytics uses cookies to track site usage. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>This site contains affiliate links. When you click these links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for more details.</p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Our site links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related questions, please visit our <a href="/">homepage</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
